    "answer": {
      "short": "$9.2\\text{ m}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}h&=1\\text{ s}\\\\\\text{Distance}&\\approx\\frac{1}{2}\\left[1.5+2(1.3+1.4+2.0+2.4)+2.7\\right]\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}(18.4)\\\\&=9.2\\text{ m}.\\end{aligned}$$",
